# Name: Bow keychain
# Use: Small crocheted bow for a keychain or bag charm
# Source: docs/sources/Keychain.docx (video: https://youtu.be/J5BA1nYeb2Q)
# Machine support: foundation chain runs now; HDC, SLST and TURN need row hardware
# Assembly: finish and shape the bow by hand as shown in the video, then attach a keyring
CH 56
REPEAT 4 # repeat the row 4 times
HDC 6
SLST 6
HDC 12
SLST 6
HDC 12
SLST 6
HDC 6
TURN
END
PAUSE Fasten off. Shape the bow by hand and attach the keyring
